  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0 is the initial release of Banned.Bangumi.\n\n\t\t\t- Added all 56 operations from the bundled Bangumi OpenAPI specification.\n\t\t\t- Added resource-oriented services for calendars, subjects, episodes, characters, persons, users, collections, revisions, and indices.\n\t\t\t- Added Bearer authentication, consistent API exceptions, cancellation, and caller-owned HttpClient support.\n\t\t\t- Added built-in IWebProxy support for SDK-managed HTTP clients.\n\t\t\t- Added strongly typed public models and consistent paginated results.\n\t\t\t- Added support for .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10.",
